        "created_at": "2017-10-10T00:29:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"dprcooke\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dprcooke/48/1961_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> dprcooke:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<div><b>Jeysie wrote:</b><br><blockquote>Giving you praise is what your creations are for. Praising yourself is just gauche. I mean, uh, if I were Biomancer, that would be my take on it.\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nWell, if a&nbsp;beautiful flesh child chooses to praise you and declare how sexy you are, then it must be true, right?\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>See, you got how it should work. You don't praise yourself, you just bask in other people's freely-given praise.</p>",
